{"id":"262fd84dbde0","publishedAt":1795091058000,"posts":[[{"size":10,"color":"#008000","text":"ネット"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"チー付与原作きになって調べたら小説2巻で漫画が22巻とかいう意味不明な作品だった。"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"text":"— 猪ニック (@raitoninngumasa) "},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/raitoninngumasa/status/2121937444795031721?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"November 15, 2026"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"href":"https://x.com/raitoninngumasa/status/2121937444795031721","text":"https://x.com/raitoninngumasa/status/2121937444795031721"},{"br":1},{"size":10,"color":"#008000","text":"記事への反応"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#FF9999","text":"\n『チー付与』【衝撃】X民さん、凄い事に気付いてしまうｗｗｗｗアニメが面白いから原作が気になって調べる→これは…凄すぎる…\n"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#CC3333","text":"\n■無茶苦茶してるけどそこもおもろいw\n"},{"br":1},{"size":18,"color":"#004466","text":"\n■すごい！\n"}]],"comments":[]}